msgid "Attollo Engineering Wasp200 Lidar"
msgstr "Attollo Engineering Wasp200 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:7
#: 4339ab6c68b84042998d1892379942da
msgid ""
"The `Wasp200 <https://www.attolloengineering.com/wasp-200-lrf.html>`__ has a"
" range of up to 200m and an update rate up to 56hz.  More specifications can"
" be found `here <https://attolloengineering.com/wp-"
"content/uploads/2021/05/XM000002-007-User-Manual-WASP-200-LRF-"
"Class-1.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Wasp200 <https://www.attolloengineering.com/wasp-200-lrf.html>`__ 量程最大 "
"200m，更新频率最高 56Hz。更多规格请参阅 `此处 <https://attolloengineering.com/wp-"
"content/uploads/2021/05/XM000002-007-User-Manual-WASP-200-LRF-"
"Class-1.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:13
#: 4edfdbd0ef424ad3b4ab2a80513fa9bb
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:15
#: 1a7d1081abb9415aacebc647abb2ef52
msgid ""
"The `Attollo Engineering online store "
"<https://attolloengineering.com/store/>`__ sells the lidar directly"
msgstr ""
"`Attollo Engineering 在线商店 <https://attolloengineering.com/store/>`__ "
"直接销售该激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:18
#: 8e7e4b73da1444df9fd8ffe079f15b6f
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:19
#: bbba7fd9d5bd476c858bbb37bebd707a
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare Serial/UART port.  The diagram"
" below shows how to connect to SERIAL4."
msgstr "串口连接可使用任意空闲的串口/UART。下图显示如何连接到 SERIAL4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:23
#: 3c664734a1fe4a2f9586bfeabea7f714
msgid ""
"If the SERIAL4 port on a Pixhawk is being used then the following parameters"
" should be set for the first rangefinder:"
msgstr "如使用 Pixhawk 的 SERIAL4 端口，应为第一个测距仪设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:25
#: ca588bc9d45b4c87a6300526f8a1ae6d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (Lidar)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 9（Lidar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:26
#: 13aea336f2124fb4b902480e70abc17f
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 18 (Wasp200)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 18（Wasp200）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:27
#: 7e4205b5331548eb8d6a718457bfb266
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 2"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:28
#: 58da583ddc7448f8a64fe3e1da24e366
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 200.  *This is the distance in meters "
"that the rangefinder can reliably read.*"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 200。*这是测距仪可可靠读取的距离，单位为米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:29
#: 3790cd1b87e1416680a1f414ff125b3e
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in metres from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = "
"0.1，*或更准确地说，是飞行器降落时测距仪到地面的距离（单位为米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装方式。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-wasp200-lidar.rst:31
#: 8f77bcff50b84417906c937cd1fc38ba
msgid ""
"If instead the SERIAL 2 port (sometimes labeled Telem2) is used then the "
"serial parameters listed above should instead be:"
msgstr "如改用 SERIAL 2 端口（有时标记为 Telem2），则上述串口参数应替换为："

